"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620458599","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620458599","name":"7. What is the average salary of a Python developer in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Freshers typically earn around \u20b93.5 to \u20b96 LPA, while experienced developers can earn \u20b98 to \u20b920 LPA or more. Salaries rise sharply with skills in AI, ML, and cloud technologies.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620473073","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620473073","name":"8. Can I become a Python developer without a computer science degree?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Python has simple syntax and vast learning resources, so many successful developers are self-taught. A strong portfolio of real projects often matters more than a formal degree.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620489958","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620489958","name":"9. Which skills give Python developers a higher salary?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Skills in machine learning, deep learning, cloud platforms, and data engineering command a premium. Developers with AI\/ML\u00a0expertise\u00a0often earn significantly more than pure web developers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620503177","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1784620503177","name":"10. What projects should I build to strengthen my Python skills?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start with small projects like a to-do app or web scraper, then move to a full web app with Django or Flask, or a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analytics-project-ideas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data analysis project<\/a>. Real projects are the best way to\u00a0demonstrate\u00a0your skills to employers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11650","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/13"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=11650"}],"version-history":[{"count":23,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11650\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21982,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11650\/revisions\/21982"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/21736"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=11650"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=11650"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=11650"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}